rketing, th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 chuy\u1ec3n \u0111\u1ed5i s\u1ed1 tr\u00ean c\u00e1c k\u00eanh truy\u1ec1n th\u00f4ng, s\u1ef1 ki\u1ec7n chuy\u00ean ng\u00e0nh.<\/p>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8F0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#FF9014;font-weight:700\">The Saigon Times \u00b7 07\/2026<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:2rem;line-height:1.4\"><a href=\"https:\/\/thesaigontimes.vn\/saigontimes\/kinh-doanh-tren-san-tmdt-buoc-vao-thoi-ky-thanh-loc-nguoi-ban\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Kinh doanh tr\u00ean s\u00e0n TM\u0110T b\u01b0\u1edbc v\u00e0o th\u1eddi k\u1ef3 thanh l\u1ecdc ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n<\/a><\/h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">G\u00f3c nh\u00ecn c\u1ee7a CEO Adtek T\u00edn L\u00ea v\u1ec1 giai \u0111o\u1ea1n thanh l\u1ecdc ng\u01b0\u1eddi b\u00e1n tr\u00ean s\u00e0n th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n t\u1eed v\u00e0 nh\u1eefng \u0111i\u1ec1u nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng c\u1ea7n chu\u1ea9n b\u1ecb \u0111\u1ec3 tr\u1ee5 v\u1eefng.<\/p>\n<p style=\"margin:0\"><a href=\"https:\/\/thesaigontimes.vn\/saigontimes\/kinh-doanh-tren-san-tmdt-buoc-vao-thoi-ky-thanh-loc-nguoi-ban\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" style=\"color:#002D72;font-weight:700\">\u0110\u1ecdc b\u00e0i vi\u1ebft &rarr;<\/a><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"border:1px solid #E3E8F0;border-radius:12px;padding:24px;margin-bottom:20px\">\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 8px;color:#FF9014;font-weight:700\">CafeBiz \u00b7 07\/2026<\/p>\n<h2 style=\"margin:0 0 12px;font-size:2rem;line-height:1.4\"><a href=\"https:\/\/cafebiz.vn\/thuc-te-moi-cua-tmdt-va-bai-toan-doi-tu-duy-cua-nha-ban-hang-176260704043203672.chn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Th\u1ef1c t\u1ebf m\u1edbi c\u1ee7a TM\u0110T v\u00e0 b\u00e0i to\u00e1n \u0111\u1ed5i t\u01b0 duy c\u1ee7a nh\u00e0 b\u00e1n h\u00e0ng<\/a><\/h2>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 12px\">Khi cu\u1ed9c ch\u01a1i th\u01b0\u01a1ng m\u1ea1i \u0111i\u1ec7n 